{"title":"Gleicher Name, anderer Ton","puid":"c-mus/dxysxl","path":"/../c-mus/topic-03-tonhoehe/block-02-stammtoene-klavier/level-05","type":"normal","voiceLang":"de","keyboardLayout":"standardDE","voice":"m7","instruction":{"voice":"f8"},"trainers":[{"trainer":"gapMulti","gapMode":"buttons","instruction":{"text":"Fülle die Lücken.","speaker":true},"soundMode":"b","textAlign":"left","shuffleButtons":true,"finishButton":false,"lsg":{"lsg":"/../c-mus/topic-03-tonhoehe/block-02-stammtoene-klavier/lsg/tonhoehe-sequenz_letters-shown-zwischentoene-400.lsg","width":600},"atoms":[{"b":"Es gibt ((sieben --siebzehn)) <b>Stammtöne</b>: das sind C, D, E, F, G, A und H. Sie entsprechen den ((++weißen schwarzen)) Tasten auf dem Klavier.","hint":{"text":"In Deutschland und Europa ist die Schreibweise, die du hier lernst, üblich. Es gibt auf der Welt aber auch andere Systeme, um Töne zu benennen und zu sortieren.","speaker":true,"label":"Info","style":"avatar"}},{"b":"Neben den Stammtönen gibt es noch ((fünf --acht)) weitere Töne. Auf dem Klavier liegen sie auf den <b>schwarzen Tasten</b>.","speaker":true,"feedback":{"end":{"text":"Die Namen der Töne auf den schwarzen Tasten sind etwas schwieriger zu merken. Du lernst sie später in einer anderen Übung kennen.","style":"avatar","speaker":true}}},{"b":"Insgesamt gibt es also ((zwölf --zwanzig)) verschiedene Töne.","speaker":true,"feedback":{"end":{"text":"Auf dem Klavier gibt es aber viel mehr Töne. Es hat ganze 88 Tasten, die alle einen anderen Ton produzieren. Wie heißen die alle? Finden wir es heraus!","speaker":true,"style":"avatar"}}}]},{"trainer":"findSequence","correctIconType":"check","finishButton":false,"hint":{"text":"Bei den Stammtönen handelt es sich um die weißen Tasten.","speaker":true,"style":"avatar"},"instruction":{"speaker":true,"text":"Tippe einmal die Stammtonreihe entlang. Beginne links mit dem tiefsten Ton."},"soundMode":"b","clickMode":"rect","disableSoundEffects":true,"lsg":{"lsg":"/../c-mus/topic-03-tonhoehe/block-02-stammtoene-klavier/lsg/tonhoehe-sequenz_double_letters.lsg","width":600},"atoms":[{"class":"correct1","color":"transparent","sound":"<voice voiceLang='de' voice='custom'>c3-piano</voice>"},{"class":"correct2","color":"transparent","sound":"<voice voiceLang='de' voice='custom'>d3-piano</voice>"},{"class":"correct3","color":"transparent","sound":"<voice voiceLang='de' voice='custom'>e3-piano</voice>"},{"class":"correct4","color":"transparent","sound":"<voice voiceLang='de' voice='custom'>f3-piano</voice>"},{"class":"correct5","color":"transparent","sound":"<voice voiceLang='de' voice='custom'>g3-piano</voice>"},{"class":"correct6","color":"transparent","sound":"<voice voiceLang='de' voice='custom'>a3-piano</voice>"},{"class":"correct7","color":"transparent","sound":"<voice voiceLang='de' voice='custom'>h3-piano</voice>"},{"class":"correct8","color":"transparent","sound":"<voice voiceLang='de' voice='custom'>c4-piano</voice>"},{"class":"correct9","color":"transparent","sound":"<voice voiceLang='de' voice='custom'>d4-piano</voice>"},{"class":"correct10","color":"transparent","sound":"<voice voiceLang='de' voice='custom'>e4-piano</voice>"},{"class":"correct11","color":"transparent","sound":"<voice voiceLang='de' voice='custom'>f4-piano</voice>"},{"class":"correct12","color":"transparent","sound":"<voice voiceLang='de' voice='custom'>g4-piano</voice>"},{"class":"correct13","color":"transparent","sound":"<voice voiceLang='de' voice='custom'>a4-piano</voice>"},{"class":"correct14","color":"transparent","sound":"<voice voiceLang='de' voice='custom'>b4-piano</voice>"},{"class":"correct15","color":"transparent","sound":"<voice voiceLang='de' voice='custom'>c5-piano</voice>"}]},{"trainer":"gapMulti","onSamePage":true,"gapMode":"buttons","soundMode":"b","textAlign":"left","shuffleButtons":true,"atoms":[{"b":"Nachdem die Stammtonreihe von ((C --G)) bis H abgeschlossen ist, beginnt sie wieder von vorn."},{"b":"Die Stammtöne und ihre Namen ((wiederholen --ändern)) sich, o